# ╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
# ║                              ZSH Configuration                            ║
# ╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝

[[ -f ~/.personal.zsh ]] && source ~/.personal.zsh

# One file per tool in ~/.config/shell/tools; env.sh, sourced by .personal.zsh, loaded them and ran their path and env phases
_dotfiles_tools setup
_dotfiles_tools late

# Machine-local overrides (work config, etc.) — not managed by chezmoi
[[ -f ~/.local.zsh ]] && source ~/.local.zsh

# Last, because zsh expands aliases into the body of every function defined after them
_dotfiles_tools aliases
unset DOTFILES_PHASE
